msgid "# Tensor R-Fork (RFork) Guide"
msgstr "# Tensor R-Fork（RFork）指南"

msgid ""
"Tensor R-Fork is a warm-start model loader for vLLM Ascend. A new instance can\n"
"request a compatible running **seed** from a planner and copy its registered NPU\n"
"weights through YuanRong TransferEngine instead of reading the checkpoint again.\n"
"The first instance still loads from storage normally."
msgstr ""
"Tensor R-Fork 是 vLLM Ascend 的模型热启动加载器。新实例可向调度器请求一个兼容且正在运行的\n"
"**种子实例**，并通过元戎 TransferEngine 复制其已注册的 NPU 权重，而无需再次读取检查点。\n"
"首个实例仍会照常从存储加载。"

msgid "## Architecture and loading flow"
msgstr "## 架构与加载流程"

msgid "RFork has four components:"
msgstr "RFork 包含四个组件："

msgid ""
"- the **planner**, which tracks seeds, health, capacity, and transfer leases;\n"
"- the **seed instance**, which registers and advertises live NPU weights;\n"
"- the **destination instance**, which prepares matching local buffers;\n"
"- **YuanRong TransferEngine**, which transfers bytes between the two instances."
msgstr ""
"- **调度器**，跟踪种子实例、健康状态、容量和传输租约；\n"
"- **种子实例**，注册并发布当前 NPU 权重；\n"
"- **目标实例**，准备匹配的本地缓冲区；\n"
"- **元戎 TransferEngine**，在两个实例之间传输字节数据。"

msgid ""
"Each TP/PP/EP worker owns an independent RFork session and exchanges only its\n"
"local shard. The seed HTTP service carries metadata; tensor data travels through\n"
"TransferEngine."
msgstr ""
"每个 TP/PP/EP worker 都拥有独立的 RFork 会话，并且只交换自身的本地分片。种子 HTTP 服务\n"
"传递元数据，张量数据则通过 TransferEngine 传输。"

msgid "The destination performs these steps:"
msgstr "目标实例执行以下步骤："

msgid ""
"1. Build a compatibility key and initialize the model on NPU.\n"
"2. Prepare the required tensor layout and register destination memory.\n"
"3. Acquire one seed lease, fetch its manifest, validate every tensor, and read\n"
"   the weights in bounded batches.\n"
"4. Release the source lease asynchronously, finish post-load processing, and\n"
"   switch the model to evaluation mode.\n"
"5. Register and advertise the loaded model as another seed when cleanup and\n"
"   lease state allow it."
msgstr ""
"1. 构建兼容性键，并在 NPU 上初始化模型。\n"
"2. 准备所需的张量布局并注册目标端内存。\n"
"3. 获取一个种子租约和对应清单，校验每个张量，再按有界批次读取权重。\n"
"4. 异步释放源端租约，完成加载后处理，并将模型切换为评估模式。\n"
"5. 清理和租约状态允许时，将已加载模型注册并发布为另一个种子实例。"

msgid ""
"If no compatible seed is available, or transfer fails, RFork unregisters the\n"
"prepared memory and uses the default loader. It refuses to allocate a second\n"
"model if cleanup cannot prove that the old registered memory is safe to release.\n"
"A failed seed-service startup does not discard a successfully loaded model."
msgstr ""
"如果没有可用的兼容种子实例，或传输失败，RFork 会注销已准备的内存并使用默认加载器。\n"
"如果清理过程无法确认旧注册内存可以安全释放，RFork 会拒绝分配第二个模型。种子服务启动失败\n"
"不会丢弃已经成功加载的模型。"

msgid "## Lifecycle guarantees"
msgstr "## 生命周期保证"

msgid ""
"`RForkSession` owns the planner lease, TransferEngine, registered tensor owners,\n"
"seed HTTP service, heartbeat, and shutdown state. Memory remains pinned while a\n"
"seed may still be read. Cleanup stops heartbeats, removes the advertisement,\n"
"stops the HTTP server, unregisters memory, and only then finalizes\n"
"TransferEngine."
msgstr ""
"`RForkSession` 管理调度器租约、TransferEngine、已注册张量的所有者、种子 HTTP 服务、\n"
"心跳和关闭状态。只要种子实例仍可能被读取，内存就会保持固定。清理时会依次停止心跳、移除发布信息、\n"
"停止 HTTP 服务并注销内存，最后才终止 TransferEngine。"

msgid ""
"Lease release uses bounded background retries. Network errors, HTTP 408/429,\n"
"and 5xx responses are retryable; other rejected responses stop immediately.\n"
"HTTP 200 and 404 are treated as acknowledged releases. An unresolved lease\n"
"delays seed publication without blocking inference, but shutdown retains the\n"
"TransferEngine resources rather than freeing memory prematurely."
msgstr ""
"租约释放会在后台进行有次数上限的重试。网络错误、HTTP 408/429 和 5xx 响应可重试；\n"
"其他拒绝响应会立即停止重试。HTTP 200 和 404 均视为释放已确认。未解决的租约会延迟种子发布，\n"
"但不会阻塞推理；关闭时会保留 TransferEngine 资源，避免过早释放内存。"

msgid ""
"Fallback restores vLLM compilation registries, compiler hooks, MoE registries,\n"
"and rotary caches to their pre-attempt state before the default loader\n"
"constructs another model. Model construction and rollback are assumed to be\n"
"serialized within each worker."
msgstr ""
"回退时会先将 vLLM 编译注册表、编译器钩子、MoE 注册表和旋转位置编码缓存恢复到尝试前状态，\n"
"再由默认加载器构建另一个模型。模型构建与回滚默认在每个 worker 内串行执行。"

msgid "## Configuration"
msgstr "## 配置"

msgid ""
"Enable RFork with `--load-format rfork` and pass a JSON object through\n"
"`--model-loader-extra-config`."
msgstr ""
"使用 `--load-format rfork` 启用 RFork，并通过 `--model-loader-extra-config`\n"
"传入一个 JSON 对象。"

msgid "| Field | Default | Description |"
msgstr "| 字段 | 默认值 | 说明 |"

msgid "| `model_url` | unset | Stable model identity; required. |"
msgstr "| `model_url` | 未设置 | 稳定的模型标识；必填。 |"

msgid ""
"| `model_deploy_strategy_name` | unset | Deployment identity; required. |"
msgstr "| `model_deploy_strategy_name` | 未设置 | 部署标识；必填。 |"

msgid "| `rfork_scheduler_url` | unset | Planner base URL; required. |"
msgstr "| `rfork_scheduler_url` | 未设置 | 调度器基础 URL；必填。 |"

msgid ""
"| `rfork_seed_timeout_sec` | `5.0` | Positive seed-server startup timeout. |"
msgstr "| `rfork_seed_timeout_sec` | `5.0` | 正数形式的种子服务启动超时时间。 |"

msgid ""
"| `rfork_request_timeout_sec` | `10.0` | Positive HTTP connect/read timeout."
" |"
msgstr "| `rfork_request_timeout_sec` | `10.0` | 正数形式的 HTTP 连接/读取超时时间。 |"

msgid ""
"| `rfork_heartbeat_interval_sec` | `30.0` | Positive JSON-only heartbeat "
"interval. |"
msgstr "| `rfork_heartbeat_interval_sec` | `30.0` | 仅支持 JSON 配置的正数心跳间隔。 |"

msgid ""
"| `rfork_lease_release_max_attempts` | `3` | Positive JSON-only release-"
"attempt limit. |"
msgstr "| `rfork_lease_release_max_attempts` | `3` | 仅支持 JSON 配置的正数释放尝试上限。 |"

msgid ""
"| `rfork_lease_release_retry_interval_sec` | `30.0` | Positive JSON-only "
"retry interval. |"
msgstr "| `rfork_lease_release_retry_interval_sec` | `30.0` | 仅支持 JSON 配置的正数重试间隔。 |"

msgid "| `rfork_seed_bind_host` | `0.0.0.0` | Local seed HTTP bind address. |"
msgstr "| `rfork_seed_bind_host` | `0.0.0.0` | 本地种子 HTTP 服务绑定地址。 |"

msgid ""
"| `rfork_seed_advertise_host` | auto | Address reported to the planner. |"
msgstr "| `rfork_seed_advertise_host` | 自动 | 向调度器报告的地址。 |"

msgid ""
"The following environment variables are fallbacks for the corresponding JSON\n"
"fields:"
msgstr "以下环境变量是对应 JSON 字段的后备配置："

msgid "| Environment variable | Default |"
msgstr "| 环境变量 | 默认值 |"

msgid "| `MODEL_URL` | unset |"
msgstr "| `MODEL_URL` | 未设置 |"

msgid "| `MODEL_DEPLOY_STRATEGY_NAME` | unset |"
msgstr "| `MODEL_DEPLOY_STRATEGY_NAME` | 未设置 |"

msgid "| `RFORK_SCHEDULER_URL` | unset |"
msgstr "| `RFORK_SCHEDULER_URL` | 未设置 |"

msgid "| `RFORK_SEED_TIMEOUT_SEC` | `5.0` |"
msgstr "| `RFORK_SEED_TIMEOUT_SEC` | `5.0` |"

msgid "| `RFORK_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SEC` | `10.0` |"
msgstr "| `RFORK_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SEC` | `10.0` |"

msgid "| `RFORK_SEED_BIND_HOST` | `0.0.0.0` |"
msgstr "| `RFORK_SEED_BIND_HOST` | `0.0.0.0` |"

msgid "| `RFORK_SEED_ADVERTISE_HOST` | auto |"
msgstr "| `RFORK_SEED_ADVERTISE_HOST` | 自动 |"

msgid "Explicit valid JSON values take precedence over environment variables."
msgstr "显式设置且有效的 JSON 值优先于环境变量。"

msgid "## Compatibility key and manifest"
msgstr "## 兼容性键与清单"

msgid ""
"The planner key includes the model identity, deployment strategy, model\n"
"revision, dtype, quantization configuration, architecture, parallel world\n"
"sizes, and Ascend weight-layout policy. Revision matching prefers the resolved\n"
"checkpoint commit hash. Use immutable model identities for local checkpoints,\n"
"because RFork does not hash checkpoint contents."
msgstr ""
"调度器键包含模型标识、部署策略、模型版本、数据类型、量化配置、架构、各并行维度的 world size，\n"
"以及昇腾权重布局策略。版本匹配优先使用解析后的检查点提交哈希。RFork 不会对检查点内容计算哈希，\n"
"因此本地检查点应使用不可变的模型标识。"

msgid ""
"RFork intentionally supports only its current metadata protocol; mixed RFork\n"
"versions are not supported. Every manifest entry contains exactly five fields:"
msgstr ""
"RFork 有意只支持当前的元数据协议，不支持混用不同 RFork 版本。每个清单条目必须正好包含五个字段："

msgid ""
"The same response also carries NPU storage formats, target-shared draft tensor\n"
"names, and selected non-tensor load state. The receiver validates names, shape,\n"
"dtype, format, element count, element size, device, and dense storage coverage\n"
"before any native read, then restores load-derived booleans that a byte transfer\n"
"cannot reproduce. Restart the planner and all RFork instances after changing\n"
"RFork code so no stale seeds remain advertised."
msgstr ""
"同一响应还会携带 NPU 存储格式、草稿模型与目标模型共享的张量名称，以及选定的非张量加载状态。\n"
"接收端会在执行任何原生读取前校验名称、形状、数据类型、格式、元素数量、元素大小、设备和稠密存储\n"
"覆盖范围，随后恢复字节传输无法复现的加载派生布尔状态。修改 RFork 代码后，请重启调度器和所有\n"
"RFork 实例，避免继续发布过期的种子实例。"

msgid "## Tensor layouts"
msgstr "## 张量布局"

msgid ""
"Quantized models transfer their prepared inference tensors. Checkpoint-layout\n"
"models transfer checkpoint tensors and run the remaining post-load hooks after\n"
"the read. RFork collects parameters, buffers, and supported runtime tensors;\n"
"empty, meta, CPU, gapped, or overlapping tensors are rejected."
msgstr ""
"量化模型传输准备好的推理张量。采用检查点布局的模型传输检查点张量，并在读取后运行其余加载后钩子。\n"
"RFork 会收集参数、缓冲区和受支持的运行时张量；空张量、meta 张量、CPU 张量以及存在间隙或重叠的\n"
"张量均会被拒绝。"

msgid ""
"Dense transposes are supported because their logical elements still cover one\n"
"continuous byte range. A receiver tensor may be reshaped with a storage-preserving\n"
"view when its element count matches the manifest. Both instances must use the\n"
"same code and effective layout; shape equality alone does not prove arbitrary\n"
"stride or NZ-padding compatibility."
msgstr ""
"RFork 支持稠密转置，因为其逻辑元素仍覆盖一段连续字节范围。当接收端张量的元素数量与清单一致时，\n"
"可以通过保持存储不变的视图调整其形状。两个实例必须使用相同代码和实际布局；仅形状相同并不能证明\n"
"任意步长或 NZ 填充布局兼容。"

msgid ""
"A draft model may reuse tensors already owned and registered by its target. If\n"
"all transferable tensors are shared, RFork skips draft transfer and post-load\n"
"rewrites. Partial overlap continues through the normal transfer path. Draft seed\n"
"publication is deferred until spec-decode finishes rebinding shared modules, so\n"
"the advertised manifest describes the final live topology."
msgstr ""
"草稿模型可以复用目标模型已经拥有并注册的张量。如果所有可传输张量均为共享张量，RFork 会跳过\n"
"草稿模型传输和加载后重写；部分重叠则继续走正常传输路径。草稿种子的发布会推迟到推测解码完成共享\n"
"模块的重新绑定之后，从而确保发布的清单描述最终生效的拓扑。"

msgid "## Planner example"
msgstr "## 调度器示例"

msgid ""
"The bundled planner is a functional example, not a production scheduler. It\n"
"reclaims abandoned leases independently of seed heartbeat expiry. Its lease TTL\n"
"defaults to 60 seconds and can be configured with `--lease-ttl-sec` or\n"
"`RFORK_MOCK_LEASE_TTL_SEC`."
msgstr ""
"随附的调度器是功能示例，并非生产调度器。它会独立于种子心跳过期机制回收被遗弃的租约。\n"
"租约 TTL 默认为 60 秒，可通过 `--lease-ttl-sec` 或 `RFORK_MOCK_LEASE_TTL_SEC` 配置。"

msgid ""
"A production planner should provide durable lease accounting, heartbeat-based\n"
"seed removal, capacity control, and observability for seed selection and\n"
"fallback frequency."
msgstr ""
"生产调度器应提供持久化租约记录、基于心跳的种子移除、容量控制，以及种子选择和回退频率的可观测性。"

msgid "## Starting vLLM"
msgstr "## 启动 vLLM"

msgid "Use the same configuration for every compatible instance:"
msgstr "所有兼容实例都应使用相同配置："

msgid "## Limitations and validation"
msgstr "## 限制与验证"

msgid ""
"- YuanRong must provide `MemoryRegistration`, `batch_register_memory_ex()`,\n"
"  `ErrorCode.kNotReady`, and `finalize()`.\n"
"- All materialized model state must reside on NPU; CPU offload is unsupported.\n"
"- Dynamic EPLB and configured static expert maps are unsupported because expert\n"
"  placement is not part of a safely transferable layout.\n"
"- Sleep mode and online weight transfer bypass RFork. Once an RFork session\n"
"  exists, runtime sleep, reload, and weight-update operations are rejected;\n"
"  restart both target and draft with `--load-format auto` for those operations.\n"
"- The seed HTTP service has no authentication. Bind it to a trusted network and\n"
"  restrict access at the deployment layer.\n"
"- Validate transfer accuracy and physical NZ coverage on the intended NPU and\n"
"  model combination; CPU tests cannot establish NPU storage correctness.\n"
"- Compare startup time, registration time, transfer throughput, seed inference\n"
"  latency, seed hit rate, and fallback rate under realistic concurrency."
msgstr ""
"- 元戎必须提供 `MemoryRegistration`、`batch_register_memory_ex()`、\n"
"  `ErrorCode.kNotReady` 和 `finalize()`。\n"
"- 所有已实体化的模型状态都必须位于 NPU；不支持 CPU offload。\n"
"- 不支持动态 EPLB 和配置的静态专家映射，因为专家放置不属于可安全传输布局的一部分。\n"
"- 睡眠模式和在线权重传输会绕过 RFork。RFork 会话一旦存在，运行时睡眠、重新加载和权重更新操作\n"
"  都会被拒绝；如需执行这些操作，请使用 `--load-format auto` 重启目标模型和草稿模型。\n"
"- 种子 HTTP 服务没有身份认证。请将其绑定到可信网络，并在部署层限制访问。\n"
"- 请在目标 NPU 和模型组合上验证传输精度与物理 NZ 覆盖；CPU 测试无法证明 NPU 存储正确。\n"
"- 请在真实并发条件下比较启动时间、注册时间、传输吞吐量、种子推理延迟、种子命中率和回退率。"

msgid ""
"Successful loads log `source=transfer`, `local`, `fallback`, or `shared_target`.\n"
"Set `VLLM_LOGGING_LEVEL=DEBUG` for per-rank registration, metadata, transfer,\n"
"lease-release, and publication timing."
msgstr ""
"加载成功时会记录 `source=transfer`、`local`、`fallback` 或 `shared_target`。\n"
"设置 `VLLM_LOGGING_LEVEL=DEBUG` 可查看各 rank 的注册、元数据、传输、租约释放和发布时间。"

msgid ""
"Each heartbeat verifies that the seed HTTP thread is still alive. If it exits,\n"
"RFork stops heartbeats and attempts to remove the advertisement while leaving\n"
"the already loaded model available for inference."
msgstr ""
"每次心跳都会确认种子 HTTP 线程仍在运行。如果该线程退出，RFork 会停止心跳并尝试移除发布信息，\n"
"同时保持已加载模型可用于推理。"
